# KillitLog.verbose is never assigned inside the app — it is flipped from outside, either by an
# instrumented test or by `adb shell setprop log.tag.KillitVerbose DEBUG` before launch. R8 cannot
# see either, so without this rule it proves the field is always false, constant-folds it, and
# deletes every traced branch. The release-build tracing switch would then silently do nothing.
#
# Verified by checking mapping.txt: without the rule the class is reported as
# `org.tamodak.killit.core.KillitLog -> R8$$REMOVED$$CLASS$$...`.
-keep class org.tamodak.killit.core.KillitLog { *; }
